        "Review text": "Title:Beautiful hotel with friendly staff.GeneralWhile my fiance was at Barnes Jewish Hospital for a hospital stay, I had the chance to stay at the Royal Sonesta Chase Hotel in St Louis. Although I never got to actually enjoy the amentities, the hotel was very clean, staff were helpful (Caren & Daniel) and the food in the restaurant was delicious. The bar was fun with a blues band playing. If you need someplace to stay close to BJH, this is the place and also ask about the BJC Hospital discount.",
